  "prefLabel": "Cor 503.01 Guardianship",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 503.01 Guardianship. During the course of the authorized treatment period, SPU staff shall assess the resident’s need for the appointment of a guardian and take actions consistent with RSA 464-A and RSA 547-B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 500) #12793, eff 5-25-19",
